	(text "POWER\nUSB-C 5V (VBUS) and 12V barrel jack. 12V -> TPS54202 buck -> +5V_DRV.\nTPS2116 priority mux: +5V_DRV preferred (PR1 threshold ~4.3V), VBUS fallback -> +5V.\n+5V feeds floppy drive power (J3) and AP7361C 3.3V LDO.\n+12V only present with barrel jack (needed for 5.25in drives)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
