	(text "v0.7: J16 internal USB header (1 +5V, 3 D-, 5 D+, 7/8 GND, pin 9 not fitted = key) parallel to USB-C: one host only.\nJ17 PC PSU (Berg 1 +5V, 2/3 GND, 4 +12V -> +12V_IN): J2 or J17, not both.\nJ18 5V priority source: 1-2 = 12V buck (default), 2-3 = PSU +5V; USB VBUS is the fallback."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 230 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
