	(text "A11c (24.10.2026): drive supplies through TPS25921A eFuses U28 (5 V) / U29 (12 V) instead of the polyfuses F2/F3 and the AO3401A/2N7002 switches Q1-Q4.\nR_ILIM 150k -> current limit 1.43-1.7 A (datasheet table), fast trip and auto-retry; OVP divider 33k/10k = 6.0 V, 100k/(10k+1k) = 14.0 V (threshold 1.39 V); ENUV from FDD5_EN/FDD12_EN via 10k, the 100k pull-downs R28/R31 keep both rails off in reset;\nC_SS 2.2 nF / 1 nF = about 2.5 ms ramp (measure at bring-up); C_IN 100 nF at the IN pins. Shunts R26/R29 + INA180 stay behind the eFuse outputs (FDD5_F/FDD12_F -> shunt -> FDD_5V/FDD_12V).\nFLT (open drain, 10k to +3V3) -> PF9/PF10: low on UV/OV/thermal AND while ENUV is low, so the firmware evaluates it only with the rail on (board_status power bits 2/3, event 0x83). D3 SMAJ15CA -> SMAJ13A (13 V standoff) on +12V.\nLayout (B3): IN/OUT 1.0 mm, C_IN at the pin, TVS and C_IN between connector and eFuse, OVP/ENUV dividers away from the load path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 295 196 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2140aca7-dde5-4198-9608-f42d4af4f9e8")
	)
